#==============================================================================================
#
#   value_parsing_2 - parsing CSS values: numbers, percentages, anchor functions and the
#                     dimensions
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/ValueParsing.cpp (lines 579-1191): <integer>, <number>,
#       <percentage> and their combinations, anchor() and anchor-size(), and the dimension
#       parsers (<angle>, <flex>, <frequency>, <length>, <resolution>, <time> and their
#       -percentage forms) with the file's static parse_literal_*_value helpers. Each falls back
#       to a math function through parse_calculated_value.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2018-2024, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2021-2025, Sam Atkins <sam@ladybird.org>
#       (the full list of ValueParsing.cpp's copyright holders is in value_parsing_1)
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
